{#
  TOP BAND — Figma 911:547 (intro), 911:577 (status clock). With the rail (v4/rail.njk) all four share the comp's y=132 edge.

  THE INTRO IS THE PAGE'S 600px READING COLUMN (456px in at 1512, which is
  the comp). It scrolls with the page.

  THE CLOCK lives at the bottom of the left panel (index.njk, v4/status.njk).
  The right-hand track below only holds it on narrow screens, where there is
  no left panel: there it drops into the flow under the intro.

#}
<header class="v4-top">
  <div class="v4-intro">
    <div class="v4-intro__head">
      {#- 1155:10698: the logo follows the name, 4px on, centred on its line. -#}
      <h1 class="v4-intro__name">
        {{ site.name }}
        {#- 528:68221, in the comp's 20 × 20 frame with the mark centred and
            room around it (so its traced outline is never clipped). Inline
            so it can draw itself in at load (_reveal.css): each shape's
            outline is traced, then filled. Same paths as icons/logo.svg. -#}
        <svg class="v4-intro__logo" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <g transform="translate(8.4236 2.6358)">
          <path pathLength="1" d="M23.1529 11.5765C23.1529 16.2466 20.3859 20.2729 16.4028 22.0998C18.0847 20.7144 19.1558 18.6127 19.1558 16.2607C19.1558 12.1289 15.8494 8.76894 11.7355 8.68518C11.6809 8.68141 11.6311 8.68141 11.5765 8.68141C11.5219 8.68141 11.472 8.68141 11.4174 8.68518C9.89082 8.768 8.68235 10.0311 8.68235 11.5755V26.0461C8.68235 30.8395 4.79341 34.7285 0 34.7285V11.5765C0 5.184 5.184 0 11.5765 0C17.9689 0 23.1529 5.184 23.1529 11.5765Z"/>
          <path pathLength="1" d="M13.1235 15.3647C14.7494 13.2313 15.6176 9.85246 14.3767 8.61157C13.1358 7.37069 10.4495 8.0451 8.37671 10.1179C6.30389 12.1907 5.88265 17.1239 7.12354 18.3647C8.36442 19.6056 11.5356 17.4484 13.1235 15.3647Z"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </h1>
      <p class="v4-intro__bio">
        {{- home.intro.bio.before -}}
        <strong>{{ home.intro.bio.strong }}</strong>
        {{- home.intro.bio.after -}}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="v4-intro__meta">
      <p class="v4-intro__location">
        <img src="/Assets/v4/icons/flag-nl.svg" width="16" height="16" alt="" />
        {{ home.intro.location }}
      </p>
      <a class="v4-intro__email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
        {{ site.email }}
        <img src="/Assets/v4/icons/arrow-up-right.svg" width="12" height="12" alt="" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="v4-aside-track">
  {#- Empty on wide screens: the clock lives at the bottom of the left panel
      (index.njk). Below 1200 scripts/v4-clock-dock.js moves it in here, under
      the intro. -#}
  <div class="v4-aside" data-clock-home></div>
</div>
